Note on third-party software: this repository contains no FreeSurfer, FSL, or
MATLAB Runtime code. The Docker image built from docker/Dockerfile downloads
and installs them at build time, and each carries its own license:

  FreeSurfer  https://surfer.nmr.mgh.harvard.edu/fswiki/FreeSurferSoftwareLicense
  FSL         https://fsl.fmrib.ox.ac.uk/fsl/fslwiki/Licence
  MATLAB MCR  https://www.mathworks.com/help/compiler/mcr-licensing.html

FSL in particular is free for academic use but requires a commercial license
for other purposes. Review these before redistributing any built image.
